  "question": {
    "text": "If a reaction follows the Arrhenius equation, the plot $\\ln k$\r\n\r\nvs $\\frac{1}{(\\mathrm{RT})}$ gives straight line with a gradient $(-\\mathrm{y})$ unit.\r\n\r\nThe energy required to activate the reactant is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
