  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "From Arrhenius equation,\r\n\r\n$k=A e^{-E_{n} / R T}$\r\n\r\n$\\ln k=\\ln A-\\frac{E_{a}}{R T}$\r\n\r\nslope $=-y$ (given) $-y=-E_{s}$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{a}}=y$",
